graph TD
    User([User Prompt / Task]) --> Planner[Planner Agent]
    
    subgraph Parallel Processing Layer
        Planner --> Data[Data Agent]
        Planner --> ML[ML Agent]
        Planner --> Research[Research Agent]
    end
    
    Data --> Reviewer[Reviewer Agent]
    ML --> Reviewer
    Research --> Reviewer
    
    Reviewer -->|Validation Passed| Report[Report Agent]
    Reviewer -->|Hallucination / Error Detected| Planner
    
    Report --> FinalOutput([Final Executive Report & Artifacts])
